WEBVTT

00:04:58.559 --> 00:05:00.048
This is your community,

00:05:00.072 --> 00:05:04.261
these are the people who have lived
side by side with you.

00:05:05.467 --> 00:05:06.633
Treated you well,

00:05:06.657 --> 00:05:07.856
treated you with respect,

00:05:07.880 --> 00:05:09.126
taken care of your kids,

00:05:09.150 --> 00:05:10.729
taken care of your grandparents.

00:05:10.753 --> 00:05:13.126
This is Luis, this is Laura,

00:05:13.150 --> 00:05:14.300
this is Jaime.

00:05:14.918 --> 00:05:16.609
This isn't some abstract,

00:05:16.633 --> 00:05:18.428
"Oh, it's happening at the border" --

00:05:18.452 --> 00:05:21.319
this is happening
in our community, right now.

00:05:23.765 --> 00:05:25.114
And the danger in this stuff

00:05:25.138 --> 00:05:28.773
is once you start normalizing
absurdities and atrocities,

00:05:28.797 --> 00:05:31.392
people think that
those instruments are legitimate.